{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Become the ultimate witch hunter</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944470/extras/04b1b71f2c818f88c547da8d7a21615a.poster.avif?t=1754340727\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944470/extras/04b1b71f2c818f88c547da8d7a21615a.webm?t=1754340727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944470/extras/04b1b71f2c818f88c547da8d7a21615a.mp4?t=1754340727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carve through hordes of enemies with your trusty axes, set them ablaze with deadly magic, dodge, kill, and die in this fast-paced, hack-and-slash roguelite where death is not the end\u2014only the next step on a cursed path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Stop the hags before it\u2019s too late</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time is of the essence. The hags have begun a massive ritual, and massive crimson monoliths have risen across the land. Prepare well, and decide how much you\u2019re willing to risk when heading out to face true evil.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Grow stronger with every kill... and death</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interrupt dark rituals to earn hexes, search the world for fonts of power, and absorb the strength of slain foes. Every action you take during the hunt will make you stronger. Receive your powers, empower them\u2014and yourself\u2014and when you inevitably fail, gain memory shards that will grant you strength for hunts to come.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore a broken world inspired by Slavic mythology</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944470/extras/9e0ed92608ba85edd4a6a2fefa61f9d6.poster.avif?t=1754340727\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944470/extras/9e0ed92608ba85edd4a6a2fefa61f9d6.webm?t=1754340727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944470/extras/9e0ed92608ba85edd4a6a2fefa61f9d6.mp4?t=1754340727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep woods, ruined farmlands, abandoned huts. Once a blooming land full of joy, now a battlefield. Battle monsters inspired by Slavic folk tales and become the hunter they fear.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2944470?t=1754340727","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944470/133fb7e9a55331d19530d43f54be30f7c14e133f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754340727","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944470/51f2658d178ce48a99dba4e16286d65ed6a26e87/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754340727","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944470/51f2658d178ce48a99dba4e16286d65ed6a26e87/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754340727","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work\r\n\r\nThis may include:\r\nFrequent violence\r\nGore"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Become the ultimate witch hunter</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944470/extras/04b1b71f2c818f88c547da8d7a21615a.poster.avif?t=1754340727\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944470/extras/04b1b71f2c818f88c547da8d7a21615a.webm?t=1754340727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944470/extras/04b1b71f2c818f88c547da8d7a21615a.mp4?t=1754340727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carve through hordes of enemies with your trusty axes, set them ablaze with deadly magic, dodge, kill, and die in this fast-paced, hack-and-slash roguelite where death is not the end\u2014only the next step on a cursed path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Stop the hags before it\u2019s too late</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time is of the essence. The hags have begun a massive ritual, and massive crimson monoliths have risen across the land. Prepare well, and decide how much you\u2019re willing to risk when heading out to face true evil.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Grow stronger with every kill... and death</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interrupt dark rituals to earn hexes, search the world for fonts of power, and absorb the strength of slain foes. Every action you take during the hunt will make you stronger. Receive your powers, empower them\u2014and yourself\u2014and when you inevitably fail, gain memory shards that will grant you strength for hunts to come.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore a broken world inspired by Slavic mythology</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944470/extras/9e0ed92608ba85edd4a6a2fefa61f9d6.poster.avif?t=1754340727\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944470/extras/9e0ed92608ba85edd4a6a2fefa61f9d6.webm?t=1754340727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944470/extras/9e0ed92608ba85edd4a6a2fefa61f9d6.mp4?t=1754340727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep woods, ruined farmlands, abandoned huts. Once a blooming land full of joy, now a battlefield. Battle monsters inspired by Slavic folk tales and become the hunter they fear.</p>","developers":["Chaotic Good Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944470/ec54e8c68ec48587bec5862cfc803e32e320d7db/header.jpg?t=1754340727","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Striga","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 7700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 10500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Chaotic Good Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Q4 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it